<title>UK: TABLE - Zeneca pre-tax profit rises 58 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Zeneca pre-tax profit rises 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (billion stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		67.8		  vs 35.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 35.0		   vs 31.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     975		    vs 619</p>
<p> Turnover		   5.363		  vs 4.900</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits before exceptional items in a range between 992 million and 1.010 billion stg. The company charged exceptional items of 36 million stg against 1996 results compared with 259 million a year before.</p>
<p>	 Company name - Zeneca Group Plc</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
